OL,3,GNEWSAWhat can be done to reduce risk of
OL,4,Awildfires?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA month on from the devastating fires
OL,7,Fthat tore through the West Midlands on
OL,8,Fthe hottest day of the year,
OL,9,Fcommunities are still reeling from what
OL,10,Fthey have lost.
OL,12,FDozens of homes across the region,
OL,13,Fincluding 19 in Stourbridge, were razed
OL,14,Fto the ground by the fires on 13
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FSome people are living with their only
OL,18,Fsurviving possessions in their car
OL,19,Fboot, while others stay in a caravan as
OL,20,Fthey wait to be rehomed.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
