OL,3,GNEWSAWhat can be done to reduce risk of
OL,4,Awildfires?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile action is needed to prevent a
OL,7,Frepeat of the wildfires, with more
OL,8,Fextreme temperatures on the horizon,
OL,9,Fwhat that should be is not yet clear.
